  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Exploring an AI Model - Marcus\r\n**Goal:** See how the choice of data and AI model changes the result.\r\n\r\n1. Pick the **Input data** and the **AI model**.\r\n2. Press **Run model**. Read the **Output** and the **Decision**.\r\n3. Try the other choices. Then turn on **Noisy input**.\r\n4. Answer the questions in your activity guide.\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "true",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "preview",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
